---
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>QM Journal</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <main transition:name="page-content" transition:animate="page-turn">
    <h1>QM Journal</h1>
    <p class="tagline">A working notebook for learning quantum mechanics by building it.</p>

    <ol class="entries">
      <li>
        <a href="/lecture-00">
          <span class="entry-num">Lecture 00</span>
          <span class="entry-title">Wave functions, Normalization, Expected values</span>
        </a>
        <p class="entry-sub">What ψ is, why we square it, and how to get real numbers out of complex math.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/exp-01">
          <span class="entry-num">Exp. 01</span>
          <span class="entry-title">The particle in a box</span>
        </a>
        <p class="entry-sub">The simplest bound state: a particle confined to an infinite square well.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </main>

  <div class="footer-wrapper">
    <SiteFooter />
  </div>

<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #faf6ee;
    --ink: #1a1a1a;
    --ink-soft: #4a4a4a;
    --ink-faint: #8a8a8a;
    --rule: #d8d1c2;
    --psi: #2a4d8f;
    --serif: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  body {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  main { max-width: 680px; margin: 4rem auto 0; padding: 0 2rem; }
  h1 {
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .tagline {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
  }
  .entries {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .entries li {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .entries li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .entries a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .entries a:hover .entry-title { color: var(--psi); }
  .entry-num {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    min-width: 6rem;
  }
  .entry-title { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .entry-sub {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0 7rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .footer-wrapper {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }
</style>
</body>
</html>